Package: webify
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, git
Recommends: nginx
Description: Self-hosted Netlify alternative for Linux
 Webify deploys static sites directly from Git repositories and serves them
 as systemd user services behind Python's built-in HTTP server. It supports
 local, cloudflared (public tunnel), and nginx-managed hosting modes.
